  "name": "Sidestep",
  "blurb": "A run seen from the side, the way a platformer is meant to be. Everything happens along one axis and inside one screen of height — walk the steps, jump the gaps, sprint the long one, time the saw, and drop to the gate. Miss and you are back at the start; there is nothing under it to land on.",
